label "Idempotency keys for agent actions diagram"
box agent 20 40 110 44 "agent step"
box store 170 30 130 64 "idempotency store|key → result" acc
box effect 340 40 100 44 "external effect"
box retry 20 160 110 44 "retry / replay|same key"
arrow agent store
arrow store effect
arrow retry store
arrow store retry dashed via=175,165
note "the first call acts; a repeat with the key replays the record — no second effect"
